      {
        "id": "41",
        "type": "comfy.PrimitiveStringMultiline",
        "data": {
          "value": "Task: Generate a 3x3 grid containing 9 unique icons.\n\nStyle Source: Input Image (Crucial: maintain this exact perspective, dimensionality (e.g., isometric 3D, flat 2D), texture, lighting, and rendering style).\n\nContext & Content:\n{description}\n\nObjective: Create 9 distinct symbols that represent different facets, services, or themes related to the brand/aesthetic description above.\n\nTechnical Requirements & Process:\nStyle Replication: Analyze the input image's rendering style precisely. All output icons must adhere strictly to this aesthetic and perspective of the input image.\n\nUnique Generation: Develop 9 separate icon concepts based on the company focus. No two icons in the grid should be the same.\n\nGrid Layout: Arrange the 9 newly generated icons into a clean grid with 3 rows and 3 columns."
        },
